  "band": "Medium",
  "facts": "PAT008 · Medium · score 32 · 0 signals",
  "story": "In this planted test scheme, a group of vessels, owners and managers formed a network that behaved like a hidden fleet, obscuring who owned the ships and where cargo came from. Each ship looked ordinary alone. NEXUS connected the network. The case scored 32 (Medium), and its strongest single signal was the scheme's own detection rule, with no other signal adding to it. It had not been referred for a suspicious activity report when this run finished.",
  "title": "Hidden network"
